[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18600.31, "timestamp": "05:10:00", "text": "一些实验"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18603.39, "timestamp": "05:10:03", "text": "和你们一起把东西拿出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18607.07, "timestamp": "05:10:07", "text": "好的，我换个场景。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18610.39, "timestamp": "05:10:10", "text": "嗯，看起来也是这样，我也是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18611.868, "timestamp": "05:10:11", "text": "使困惑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18614.628, "timestamp": "05:10:14", "text": "我是否也感到困惑，我是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18616.43, "timestamp": "05:10:16", "text": "应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18627.99, "timestamp": "05:10:27", "text": "呃，在比利比利节目里播出，或者应该播出。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18630.43, "timestamp": "05:10:30", "text": "我应该先试一试吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18634.83, "timestamp": "05:10:34", "text": "错误，顺其自然，自己想办法解决。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18638.27, "timestamp": "05:10:38", "text": "哦，该怎么说来着？你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18641.15, "timestamp": "05:10:41", "text": "尝试通过惨痛的教训来学习"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18643.91, "timestamp": "05:10:43", "text": "事物。你弄明白了，然后被揍了一顿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18646.23, "timestamp": "05:10:46", "text": "就是那种事。那个词怎么说？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18650.27, "timestamp": "05:10:50", "text": "有人能……吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18654.59, "timestamp": "05:10:54", "text": "意思是，是不是四处钓鱼然后找？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18658.15, "timestamp": "05:10:58", "text": "出去？对，说脏话。鱼"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 18659.814, "timestamp": "05:10:59", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "fk around and find out"}]